fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"codecparsers/gsth264parser.html#gst_h264_parser_parse_pps","fragment":"\n\tgst_h264_parser_parse_pps\n\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.prototype.h264_parser_parse_pps\n\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.h264_parser_parse_pps\n\nParses nalu containing a Picture Parameter Set, and fills pps.\nThe resulting pps data structure must be deallocated by the caller using\ngst_h264_pps_clear.\nParameters:\na GstH264NalParser\nThe GST_H264_NAL_PPS GstH264NalUnit to parse\nThe GstH264PPS to fill.\na GstH264ParserResult\nParses nalu containing a Picture Parameter Set, and fills pps.\nThe resulting pps data structure must be deallocated by the caller using\nGstCodecParsers.H264PPS.prototype.clear.\nParameters:\na GstCodecParsers.H264NalParser\nThe GstCodecParsers.H264NalUnitType.PPS GstCodecParsers.H264NalUnit to parse\nThe GstCodecParsers.H264PPS to fill.\na GstCodecParsers.H264ParserResult\nParses nalu containing a Picture Parameter Set, and fills pps.\nThe resulting pps data structure must be deallocated by the caller using\nGstCodecParsers.H264PPS.clear.\nParameters:\na GstCodecParsers.H264NalParser\nThe GstCodecParsers.H264NalUnitType.PPS GstCodecParsers.H264NalUnit to parse\nThe GstCodecParsers.H264PPS to fill.\na GstCodecParsers.H264ParserResult\n"});